- Explicit orthogonal routes and branch junctions for all three diagrams.
- Command/actual/velocity logging branches separated from the signal paths.
- Position feedback routed along the lower edge of each servo subsystem.
- Local Goto/From tag safe_close_v replaces the long shared speed-limit return.
- No arithmetic, delay, solver or controller parameter changes.

